From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: System Electronics <ci@sysele.local>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] deps/v8/src/inspector/v8-string-conversions.h: add missing
 <cstdint> include for GCC 13

Same root cause as the fix in src/base/logging.h: GCC 13's libstdc++ no
longer transitively pulls in <cstdint> via <string>, so uint16_t is not
declared here either.

Upstream-Status: Backport
Signed-off-by: System Electronics <ci@sysele.local>
---
 deps/v8/src/inspector/v8-string-conversions.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/deps/v8/src/inspector/v8-string-conversions.h b/deps/v8/src/inspector/v8-string-conversions.h
--- a/deps/v8/src/inspector/v8-string-conversions.h
+++ b/deps/v8/src/inspector/v8-string-conversions.h
@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@
 #ifndef V8_INSPECTOR_V8_STRING_CONVERSIONS_H_
 #define V8_INSPECTOR_V8_STRING_CONVERSIONS_H_

+#include <cstdint>
 #include <string>

 // Conversion routines between UT8 and UTF16, used by string-16.{h,cc}. You may
--
2.34.1
